# The build context of examples/feature-flags/Dockerfile, which BuildKit reads
# instead of the root .dockerignore. The context is the repository root, and
# the image needs only the Go sources of sigil.wasm, the Rust binding and the
# example, so everything else is left out, local builds above all: target/
# directories are gigabytes and would shadow what the image builds itself.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/sigil-wasm/
!internal/
!bindings/rust/
!examples/feature-flags/

**/target/
**/dist/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
examples/feature-flags/results/
